### Health (no auth)
**GET** `/health` → 200
```bash
curl https://api.myarchivist.ai/health

Returns:

{ "status": "healthy", "service": "archivist-api", "version": "1.0.0", "environment": "production", "port": 8000, "timestamp": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.123456Z" }


